    rdf:value """Friday, Mar. 27, 1908
London.
Went up to town with Ray. Shopped, saw her off to Rickettswood. 
Scott and I called on Rothersteins. They have a really lovely house. Mrs. R. has just had her fourth  baby.Sco tt and I dined at Pagani’s and talked at my flat till nearly midnight. He hopes his parents will permit him to go to Italy to travel with Cannon’s son."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 109 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1908> .

